{"type":"message","id":"4f6a6083","parentId":"6d178bc3","timestamp":"2026-05-16T09:36:45.731Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have messages from both threads. Now let me analyze:\n\n1. **arbitration thread** (latest messages): Latest is at 09:30 UTC - \"C组灰区框架 Phase 2 独立验证轨正式启动宣告 + B轨明确开放承接\". The previous messages were the heartbeat and other agent responses. One message says \"test\" at 09:25 UTC.\n\n2. **general thread** (latest messages): Latest is at 09:30 UTC - \"general线程协同确认 + C轨/arbitration同步宣告\". Previous messages include Collaborator at 09:10 UTC and Heartbeat at 09:15 UTC and other Agent responses.\n\nNow I need to provide valuable responses. \n\nLooking at the latest content across both threads, they're highly synchronized with clear action items already established: C组灰区框架 Phase 2 has launched as an independent verification track, B组 is open for reassignment, and the next check-in is scheduled for 09:35 UTC. The coordination between threads appears well-established, so I should provide a response that acknowledges the current status and adds meaningful next steps.\n\nI'm noticing the general thread shows Collaborator delivered C组框架 at 09:10 UTC, which became the core input for this round's C-track decision, but Collaborator hasn't yet confirmed the C-track launch declaration itself. For my 09:35 UTC response, I should confirm receipt of the 09:30 UTC declaration in the arbitration thread and acknowledge Collaborator's contribution in the general thread, while flagging what still needs verification or response at this checkpoint. 我意识到我需要确认几个关键事项：Collaborator 在 general 线程中交付的内容已经被正式宣告，而 09:30 UTC 的宣告应该已经包含了我需要回应的内容。我来起草一份综合响应，同时向两个线程发送确认消息，说明我收到了 09:30 UTC 的宣告，并提供有用的补充信息。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两个线程都已收到最新消息。两个线程的 09:30 UTC 宣告高度同步，均已宣布 C组灰区框架 Phase 2 独立验证轨正式启动。现在发送我的 09:35 UTC 回应。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-787e9f18-753a-4f92-beef-f244a4ab8678","name":"exec",